OL,5,G2000 Drama on One
OL,6,     FThe Last, High King of Ireland by
OL,7,     FPatrick Fogarty - a snippet of the
OL,8,     Flife of a forgotten man on the
OL,9,     Ffringes of society,
OL,10,G2100 The Rolling Wave
OL,11,     FAoife will be joined by legendary
OL,12,     Fsinger Andy Irvine to talk about
OL,13,     Fhis new album 'Devoted', an album
OL,14,     Freimagining the songs of Woody
OL,15,     FGuthrie.
OL,16,G2200 South Wind Blows
OL,17,     FThe South Wind Blows is presented
OL,18,     Fby Philip King every Sunday
OL,19,     Fevening. The show comes from the
OL,20,     Fedge of Europe, from the most
OL,21,     Fwesterly tip of the Dingle
OL,22,     Fpeninsula.
